<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p style="color: var(--muted)"><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

  <p>
    The Highway Old Students' Association ("HOSA", "we", "us") respects your
    privacy. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your
    rights over it.
  </p>

  <h2>1. What We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Account information:</strong> your email address and password
      (stored securely as a hash).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Profile information:</strong> your name, graduation year,
      district, profession, and biography. You control who can see this.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Directory visibility:</strong> you choose whether to appear in the
      public alumni directory.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Activity data:</strong> saved items, RSVPs, event registrations,
      and mentorship requests.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. What We Do Not Collect</h2>
  <p>
    We do not collect your physical address, national ID, financial details, or
    precise location. We do not use third-party advertising trackers or sell
    your data to anyone.
  </p>

  <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
  <p>
    We use your data solely to operate HOSA: connecting you with other alumni,
    running events, coordinating mentorship, and supporting the school. We never
    use it for marketing outside of HOSA communications.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Who Can See Your Data</h2>
  <p>
    By default, your email and phone are private. You can choose to share them
    in the directory via your <a href="/dashboard/profile">Profile Settings</a>.
    HOSA administrators can access your data to operate the site but cannot see
    your password.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under Uganda's Data Protection and Privacy Act (2019), you have the right
    to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access the personal data we hold about you.</li>
    <li>Correct inaccurate information.</li>
    <li>Request deletion of your account and data.</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent for directory visibility at any time.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To exercise these rights, email
    <a href="mailto:privacy@hosa-uganda.org">privacy@hosa-uganda.org</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Active accounts retain their data indefinitely. Deactivated accounts are
    retained for 90 days, then permanently deleted unless you have requested a
    shorter retention window.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For all privacy questions, contact
    <a href="mailto:privacy@hosa-uganda.org">privacy@hosa-uganda.org</a>.
  </p>
</div>
